  "body_html": "<h4>Quick Summary</h4><ul><li><p>Overall market continues its bullish trend, despite headlines misleading investors.</p></li><li><p>Future interest rates to be aware of… <strong>increased rates</strong> are likely early 2027</p></li><li><p>For <strong>Short Term Investors</strong> (few days holding time), a stock to BUY</p><div><hr></div></li></ul><h4>Detailed Summary</h4><p>Buy…wait…wait… and wait some more. That has been the story of the stock market the last few weeks. The market has continued its journey upwards, but by no means, has it been a “relaxing ride.” The S&amp;P 500 hit all time highs on the 14th and has since pulled back slightly, but nothing alarming. My expectations is that the market will reverse upwards again soon. </p><h4>Some commentary that stood out to me yesterday:</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Applied Digital Corporation,</strong> <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$APLD&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>: One of the stocks I hold, APLD, has been particularly tumultuous this year. Someone in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/b7f4035d-fcb6-44e8-911b-6712dbc96cb7\">Main chat</a> said yesterday: “Damn, APLD dove 20% since Friday!” They aren’t wrong…but zoom out and ask whether the drop, relative to the trend, has broken that trend or not. When we look, we see that APLD has also risen ~136% since March. We have higher highs, a break out in the local highs and higher lows. Bull trend remains very well established here. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png\" width=\"1217\" height=\"763\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:763,&quot;width&quot;:1217,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:208323,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198549421?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!pHPf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2ebb47b7-10ac-4f2b-9635-b977cdf78090_1217x763.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Has the trend that we invested into been broken? No. </figcaption></figure></div></li><li><p><strong>Netflix, </strong><span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NFLX&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> As many of my long time followers are aware, I started noticing circle jerking and hopeful price targets coinciding with distribution patterns on Netflix back September and October of 2025, prompting a short position. If you didn’t see my article on “<a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/brief-stock-market-update-when-to?r=4z8lgl\">When to sell</a>”, I highly recommend it. The stock proceeded to plummet more than -35% over the next 4 months. No I didn’t catch the full move, we are not here to catch tops or bottoms…but we did make a healthy profit from the downward trend. Anyways, someone commented that Netflix is looking good yesterday. I tend to agree. Though it is NOT in investable territory for me personally (price below 200 day moving average is an automatic “no” for me), the stock had a significant gap up 25-27 February, clear breakouts with volume. Because of this, I think odds are really in favor of a resumed bull trend soon. Will it be an easy ride? Unlikely.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"727\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:727,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:265286,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198549421?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aUX9!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6513d561-6ff7-40b8-a012-f56b78acbcc9_1611x804.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Clear breakouts, with volume back on the 25th and 27th of February. When and if price gets back above the 200 day moving average, NFLX could provide several bullish short term trends, and long term trends. I don’t “buy the dip” but if I did, I would buy this one. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Another discussion in the main chat was about interest rates, specifically<strong> federal interest rates </strong>here. You do not need to be an economist or a numbers wizard to apply some basic thinking to the markets. </p><h4>Also, this is the single biggest mistake I see content creators mislead viewers on! </h4><p>They do not apply leads or lags to the stock market. Remember, the STOCK MARKET IS A FORWARD LOOKING DISCOUNTING MECHANISM. The federal interest rates you see today…yea, that was priced in ~6 months ago. Absolutely useless information. So when influencers or investors base their decisions on TODAY’S interest rates, the market often goes against them because <em>they are late to the party.</em> I rarely watch FOMC, unless I want some giggles. </p><p>These are general rules… but <em>in general</em> I ask myself these questions, and depending on my answer, will influence whether I say the market is “bullish” “bearish” “bullish/crabby”. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:359923,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198549421?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Yk-D!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4de114c4-f8e0-464d-a109-b2230987fdfc_1600x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Notice the key word here is “speculated”. Because the market is a forward looking, discounting mechanism, I want the speculations of the future to be in the bullish category. </figcaption></figure></div><p>Not to sound like a egotistical douche… but I’ve crushed many influencers over the years with this simple secret. So can you.</p><p>Now, with that general rule in mind, a great place to get <em><strong>speculated</strong></em> future Federal Interest rate <em>forecasts</em> is the <a href=\"https://www.cmegroup.com/markets/interest-rates/cme-fedwatch-tool.html\">CME Fed Watch Tool</a>. I have not seen CME forecasts miss, not once. So they are incredibly reliable (though there are never any guarantees). And notice in the image below, I went to “9 December 2026”… I do not care about 17 June FOMC or even 29 July FOMC…useless information the market has already priced in. It is unlikely that the market has priced in December or even January 2027 yet, that is what we care about. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png\" width=\"1406\" height=\"696\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:696,&quot;width&quot;:1406,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:48771,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198549421?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!15dN!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F84a175ff-0da9-4615-a32a-66539abe81b7_1406x696.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">We want to review Federal Interest Rates in December 2026 and January 2027. These are unlikely to have been priced in yet. </figcaption></figure></div><p>We see that there is a 42.5% chance that interest rates remain the same… but we also have a noticeable spike that rates will actually be RAISED, a 40.2% chance. That means that some of these institutions are picking up information that you and I are unlikely aware of. Most retail are speculating that rates will be cut further…clearly the institutions disagree with retail (normal). In fact, when we pull up January 2027 probabilities, the raised rates (375-400) is actually the leader.  </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png\" width=\"1408\" height=\"704\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:704,&quot;width&quot;:1408,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:48956,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/198549421?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!isdc!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcf36772e-6183-433a-9c14-9553a56a6b61_1408x704.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Raised rates leads the probabilities at 41.5%</figcaption></figure></div><p>So, considering the general rules I outlined above, and the fact that the speculated future rates point towards raising of federal interest rates, is likely a big reason we are seeing so much chop in the markets, the fact that rates are speculated to stay the same…and then transition to higher rates. It is beginning to price in those raised rate probabilities. Does that mean the bull market is over? No, not at all. Couple of reasons:</p><ol><li><p>January 2027 is ~8 months away. Still outside the ~6 month general rule window. </p></li><li><p>The probability is still below 50%…. it is competing with the 350-375 rates at 32.8%. It’s not a clear winner yet. </p></li><li><p>Price action continues to make all time highs and trend above major moving averages. Price action is king and the best indicator. </p></li></ol><p>This is just something to monitor for now. If we start to see increased rate’s probabilities climb higher, or dramatic market responses downwards, then we will approach more cautiously. But until then, trend is friend, and trend is up. </p><p>Please do not forget to like ❤️ and share this post; it is the only way we beat out the AI slop. Thanks! </p><h4>Now for the short term investors, those that like to hold positions for a few days, this stock looked outstanding…</h4>",
